    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mesomkulola ga Mlungu ali pa citengu cakwe kwinani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pinamasile kuyiwona yindu yosopeyi, nasagamile soni ni naweni kuti kwaliji kwana mlango kwinani. Nipo napikene jwine ali mkuŵeceta ni une mu liloŵe mpela linapikene pandanda lila, lilyapikanikaga mpela lipenga. Ŵasalile kuti, “Myice akuno kuti nimlosye yindu yitiyitendekwe pitiyimale yeleyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jijojo Msimu wa Mlungu waliji mkulamulila une, nipo kwinaniko naciweni citengu ca ucimwene, nambo jwine ali atemi pa citengupo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.1.26+EZK.1.27+EZK.1.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 1:26-28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.10.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwonece wa juŵatemi pa citengupo waliji mpela maganga ga mtengo wapenani gakolanjidwa jasipa ni kaneliyani, nambo soni kusyungulila citenguco paliji pana ukunje wa ula, wele uwonece wakwe waliji mpela liganga lya emeladi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kucisyungulila citengu ca ucimweneco papali yitengu yine ya ucimwene makumi gaŵili ni mcece. Pa yitengupo patemi acayimwene makumi gaŵili ni mcece ali awete yakuwala yeswela ni yisindi ya golidi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ya ucimwene ku mitwe jawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutyocela mu citengumo mwakopokaga kumesya kwa njasi, masegwe ni kulindima. Pasogolo pa citengupo cicoco pakolelaga yenje msano ni yiŵili, yele yili misimu msano ni jiŵili ja Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
